WEBVTT

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:15.415
My right hand
holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:20.220
And my left holds
one of silver.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.357
Never one
without the other,

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:37.504
Two unseen bowls
for each of us.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:45.912
The golden one
is filled with joy,

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:53.320
shining warmly.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:58.058
Since we met,
my golden bowl

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:04.998
cannot hold all my
happiness and love.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:15.209
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:22.483
I would leave
my past behind...

00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:27.288
For you, for the
sake of love,

00:01:27.288 --> 00:01:34.228
I would empty the
bowls of my past.

00:01:35.896 --> 00:01:41.902
Based on the manga by the beloved
Ikeda Riyoko

00:02:01.522 --> 00:02:04.058
Sorry, I'm late...

00:02:04.258 --> 00:02:06.928
It's OK. I'm used to it.

00:02:06.928 --> 00:02:08.996
You're annoyed anyway, I can tell.

00:02:09.597 --> 00:02:12.600
How's your thesis...
half-done, maybe?

00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:14.335
Silly question...

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.205
Another break from work, then...
<b> </b>

00:02:17.205 --> 00:02:18.272
Another break from work, then...
Now?

00:02:18.873 --> 00:02:20.007
Me too.

00:02:21.743 --> 00:02:22.744
So?

00:02:23.878 --> 00:02:25.346
So what did you do?

00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:26.681
About what?

00:02:27.682 --> 00:02:29.817
The Nyugaku-iwai, the high
school gift... you sent it?

00:02:31.352 --> 00:02:32.286
Yeah...

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.088
With your name on it?

00:02:35.223 --> 00:02:38.293
Yes... They'll find
out sooner or later....

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.169
Ever hear of Seiran Sorority?

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.505
Yeah... I've heard of it...

00:02:51.239 --> 00:02:54.509
She was selected as a candidate.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.383
What the heck does that mean?

00:03:03.118 --> 00:03:05.320
Well, it's not that
easy to explain...

00:03:07.055 --> 00:03:10.258
Brother, to my surprise...

00:03:10.392 --> 00:03:13.128
I was selected
as a candidate!

00:03:14.195 --> 00:03:19.534
3. Is Nanako Disqualified?

00:03:21.002 --> 00:03:26.541
I collected some information about what
the sorority sisters dislike most.

00:03:26.675 --> 00:03:28.543
Girls who cannot use keigo.

00:03:28.543 --> 00:03:32.881
Girls who cannot dress and
behave in a "classy" manner;

00:03:32.881 --> 00:03:36.351
And especially, girls
who can't be punctual.

00:03:39.621 --> 00:03:44.026
Who is it I can hear from so far
away, ladies?... That's better.

00:03:53.035 --> 00:03:53.969
Who is that?
<b> </b>

00:03:53.969 --> 00:03:55.103
Who is that?
It's her.

00:03:55.103 --> 00:03:56.038
Is she the one?
<b> </b>

00:03:56.038 --> 00:03:59.975
Is she the one?
She's the outsider who was
chosen as a candidate!

00:03:59.975 --> 00:04:02.244
I don't see anything
special about her.

00:04:02.978 --> 00:04:05.848
Not exceptionally pretty...

00:04:06.381 --> 00:04:09.251
So, she must be the only
daughter of a very rich family.

00:04:11.053 --> 00:04:13.589
No, she's lower middle-class.

00:04:13.589 --> 00:04:16.525
You're kidding. That
makes no sense to me.

00:04:17.459 --> 00:04:19.261
I can't figure it out either.

00:04:37.479 --> 00:04:39.215
This is a narrow stairway.

00:04:39.215 --> 00:04:41.417
We can't pass if you
walk spread out like that.

00:04:45.421 --> 00:04:47.823
By all means, go on, then...

00:04:47.823 --> 00:04:50.359
Thank you. Nanako, let's go.

00:04:51.827 --> 00:04:54.030
You must have used
some kind of dirty trick.

00:04:55.564 --> 00:04:58.901
Otherwise you'd never have
been selected as a candidate.

00:05:01.304 --> 00:05:03.039
What a nasty upstart she is!

00:05:03.039 --> 00:05:05.908
Somehow she got
chosen over you!

00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:09.178
She must have some very
sneaky way of cheating.

00:05:09.512 --> 00:05:13.649
It would be even more mortifying
if she is chosen as a member!

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.253
It's ok. She'll withdraw.

00:05:21.524 --> 00:05:23.593
I finally got the goods on her.
<b> </b>

00:05:23.593 --> 00:05:24.460
I finally got the goods on her.
What "goods"?

00:05:24.861 --> 00:05:29.332
I found Nanako Misonoo's weakness.
A truth she can't deny...

00:05:30.533 --> 00:05:32.535
How did you find this out?

00:05:32.535 --> 00:05:34.671
In my father's office,

00:05:34.671 --> 00:05:37.140
There are many such
secrets to be found.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.610
That's right! Your father
is a famous lawyer!

00:05:40.743 --> 00:05:43.546
I wish I'd been born
into the elite like you.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.483
And you, the most
elite of the elite...

00:05:55.425 --> 00:05:57.293
How I hate her!

00:05:58.228 --> 00:06:00.430
There's always
some girl like her...

00:06:00.563 --> 00:06:02.632
Feigning such innocence...

00:06:02.632 --> 00:06:04.701
Who somehow steals
what is rightfully mine!

00:06:09.907 --> 00:06:11.175
SHUT UP!

00:06:24.054 --> 00:06:26.590
Nanako, it's Tomoko.

00:06:28.325 --> 00:06:29.926
What's up?

00:06:30.327 --> 00:06:31.595
How are you?

00:06:32.329 --> 00:06:35.465
OK. I've been better.
But I'm OK.

00:06:35.866 --> 00:06:36.867
I see.

00:06:36.867 --> 00:06:40.070
What is it?
Anything urgent?

00:06:41.138 --> 00:06:45.275
Nothing in particular. Just a
meaningless good-night call,

00:06:45.275 --> 00:06:45.942
So anyway good night!

00:06:48.278 --> 00:06:49.413
Good night...

00:06:50.547 --> 00:06:53.150
They say a rumor runs
its course in 75 days.

00:06:54.418 --> 00:06:57.220
75 more days, Nanako.

00:07:03.894 --> 00:07:05.429
Bye! See you later!
<b> </b>

00:07:05.429 --> 00:07:06.296
Bye! See you later!
Ok!

00:07:11.301 --> 00:07:13.504
Good morning, Misonoo-san!

00:07:14.037 --> 00:07:15.239
Good Morning!

00:07:15.506 --> 00:07:19.576
Hey, listen, what did you decide
to wear to the party tomorrow?

00:07:20.177 --> 00:07:22.513
I'm still torn!

00:07:22.846 --> 00:07:25.716
Between a black dress
and a bright red one.

00:07:26.316 --> 00:07:30.854
But yours has got to be pink.
Especially powder pink.

00:07:35.726 --> 00:07:37.661
What do you want?

00:07:41.398 --> 00:07:46.003
Strange. They look at
us even colder today.

00:07:50.608 --> 00:07:52.810
What is that?

00:07:54.612 --> 00:07:58.082
I'm dreading some sort
of exam announcement...

00:07:58.082 --> 00:08:00.351
What? An exam?

00:08:00.551 --> 00:08:02.153
Good Morning!

00:08:02.486 --> 00:08:03.754
Morning...

00:08:04.355 --> 00:08:05.823
Beats me...

00:08:05.823 --> 00:08:08.826
Sometimes they have
unscheduled exams.

00:08:12.363 --> 00:08:14.565
Well, it says...

00:08:15.032 --> 00:08:20.171
We suspect there was cheating in the
selection of the Sorority candidates,

00:08:20.171 --> 00:08:26.777
...and this cheating led to the
selection of Nanako Misonoo.

00:08:26.777 --> 00:08:34.052
She doesn't have the
looks and charm to qualify.

00:08:34.852 --> 00:08:41.392
More importantly, she's not really the
daughter of Professor Misonoo.

00:08:41.392 --> 00:08:47.332
It's an injustice that such a person
be selected as a candidate.

00:08:51.336 --> 00:08:52.403
This is terrible!

00:08:53.938 --> 00:08:55.139
Misonoo-san!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.076
Tomoko!
Tomoko!

00:08:58.076 --> 00:08:59.210
Don't go!

00:08:59.811 --> 00:09:02.280
Listen, I'm on your side!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.882
Nanako-san!

00:09:03.949 --> 00:09:05.283
Tomoko!

00:09:10.622 --> 00:09:11.756
Nanako-san...

00:09:14.626 --> 00:09:15.827
Move aside!

00:09:16.027 --> 00:09:17.429
Move aside a moment...

00:09:20.165 --> 00:09:22.567
This garbage belongs
in a garbage can!

00:09:33.845 --> 00:09:35.180
This is too much!

00:10:09.348 --> 00:10:10.482
I'm sorry!

00:10:10.949 --> 00:10:13.352
Are you... are you OK?

00:10:13.352 --> 00:10:16.221
I'm so sorry... I...

00:10:17.156 --> 00:10:18.223
Over there...

00:10:18.357 --> 00:10:19.491
What?

00:10:20.559 --> 00:10:22.027
Hand it here...

00:10:23.028 --> 00:10:25.164
These pills?

00:10:35.107 --> 00:10:36.909
Like a man...

00:10:37.443 --> 00:10:40.312
...there's something about
her almost like a man...

00:11:00.266 --> 00:11:02.001
So cruel.

00:11:02.535 --> 00:11:04.870
Who would do such a thing?

00:11:06.138 --> 00:11:07.406
I decided...

00:11:08.541 --> 00:11:11.277
I decided not to go to the party.

00:11:13.279 --> 00:11:17.149
After such an incident...
I just can't go.

00:11:17.483 --> 00:11:19.819
You were... defeated.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.021
Yes.
<b> </b>

00:11:22.088 --> 00:11:23.155
Yes.
That means...

00:11:23.623 --> 00:11:26.092
The winner is hate itself.

00:11:26.759 --> 00:11:28.227
The winner.

00:11:30.897 --> 00:11:32.298
Painful, isn't it?

00:11:35.101 --> 00:11:37.036
Well, is it finally painful enough?

00:11:37.637 --> 00:11:43.042
I know how much you
respect and love your father!

00:11:43.042 --> 00:11:44.777
Sure, you're not
his real daughter...

00:11:44.777 --> 00:11:47.246
...but I know how
close you two are.

00:11:47.246 --> 00:11:49.782
So this is torturing me as well!

00:11:49.782 --> 00:11:54.053
This is a dirty thing they are doing to you,
and an outrageous insult, Nanako!

00:11:55.455 --> 00:11:56.456
Tomoko...
<b> </b>

00:11:56.456 --> 00:11:58.858
Tomoko...
Go!! Go to the party!

00:11:58.858 --> 00:12:01.528
Not going because of this
would just increase the pain.

00:12:02.195 --> 00:12:02.729
But..
<b> </b>

00:12:02.729 --> 00:12:05.064
But..
There's nothing to be ashamed of!

00:12:05.064 --> 00:12:08.001
Nothing at all! You are innocent!

00:12:08.201 --> 00:12:09.336
GO!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:13.406
But damn. Not going
was my final decision.

00:12:14.274 --> 00:12:16.876
That's the decision you made.

00:12:23.817 --> 00:12:27.153
I really wonder
why I was selected.

00:12:28.154 --> 00:12:30.690
I would have selected you, Nanako.
<b> </b>

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:31.625
I would have selected you, Nanako.
What!?

00:12:34.761 --> 00:12:35.896
Right here!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.698
Your real self.

00:12:38.765 --> 00:12:42.636
The Sorority members
saw into your heart!

00:12:43.303 --> 00:12:44.171
Tomoko!
<b> </b>

00:12:44.171 --> 00:12:46.773
Tomoko!
Don't... don't cry!

00:13:03.991 --> 00:13:05.659
Misonoo-san!

00:13:09.596 --> 00:13:13.066
Where have you been?
I thought you might have gone home.

00:13:13.066 --> 00:13:14.868
Sorry to make you worry.

00:13:14.868 --> 00:13:16.336
It's OK.

00:13:16.336 --> 00:13:19.273
Please don't say
you won't attend...

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.874
Tomorrow's party...

00:13:22.476 --> 00:13:23.610
I will...

00:13:26.079 --> 00:13:27.681
I will attend.

00:13:38.759 --> 00:13:39.760
My dear brother...

00:13:40.961 --> 00:13:44.298
I confess... I must
confess that...

00:13:45.299 --> 00:13:48.302
There's been a lot happening and
I've been thinking a lot.

00:13:49.169 --> 00:13:52.973
When I decided to go, I somehow thought
I might be accepted after all.

00:13:54.108 --> 00:13:58.979
I don't have much
confidence, nor any faith,

00:13:59.647 --> 00:14:02.917
But I thought,
wouldn't it be nice...

00:14:03.117 --> 00:14:05.786
Wouldn't it be nice...

00:14:06.654 --> 00:14:12.059
To see and experience the Big Sister's
gorgeous life style.

00:14:12.793 --> 00:14:21.002
I... I realized that I am somewhat vain,
frivolous, and a social butterfly...

00:14:21.802 --> 00:14:25.273
Despite its perhaps being
wrong, I'm still so excited.

00:14:25.873 --> 00:14:29.544
This feeling is new to
me... completely new.

00:14:47.428 --> 00:14:49.630
Nanako? Nanako-san?

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:52.567
Yes?

00:14:53.368 --> 00:14:56.971
There was a phone call
from Ichinomiya Fukiko.

00:14:57.038 --> 00:14:57.905
Yes?
<b> </b>

00:14:57.905 --> 00:14:59.173
Yes?
From Miya-sama?

00:14:59.173 --> 00:15:02.577
Yes, about tomorrow's Soro...
Soro,,,

00:15:02.644 --> 00:15:05.914
It's Sorority, Mom.

00:15:05.981 --> 00:15:08.383
Yes, the Sorority party...

00:15:08.383 --> 00:15:12.520
The time is changed to three
o'clock. And she said "hello".

00:15:13.054 --> 00:15:16.324
Three o'clock? OK. Thank you!

00:15:40.482 --> 00:15:41.616
Nanako!

00:15:45.954 --> 00:15:47.889
I'm stunned!

00:15:50.425 --> 00:15:52.627
You really dressed up!

00:15:53.361 --> 00:15:57.632
I can tell you're determined
to make a perfect impression.

00:15:57.699 --> 00:15:59.034
I'm impressed!

00:15:59.301 --> 00:16:02.637
Well, first things first!
Please be so good as to kindly be seated!

00:16:10.045 --> 00:16:14.783
Well I'm stumped! That's you
asked to meet me at twelve!

00:16:14.783 --> 00:16:17.653
That's the time for
the Sorority party!

00:16:19.187 --> 00:16:22.658
The time was changed!
That's why we can meet now.

00:16:25.127 --> 00:16:27.730
If we can't bake a cake
like I promised...

00:16:27.797 --> 00:16:30.933
At least we can eat one!

00:16:31.467 --> 00:16:32.468
Your treat, right?

00:16:32.935 --> 00:16:34.269
I thought it was YOUR treat!

00:16:34.269 --> 00:16:38.741
You said so on the phone!

00:16:39.808 --> 00:16:40.943
You remembered!

00:16:42.878 --> 00:16:46.015
So I'll order... some angel
cake, a lemon square,

00:16:46.015 --> 00:16:49.351
and a New York cheese
cake with blue berries!

00:17:17.713 --> 00:17:20.249
What can Nanako be doing?

00:17:21.784 --> 00:17:22.852
Shinobu-san?

00:17:23.786 --> 00:17:24.720
Yes?
<b> </b>

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:27.523
Yes?
Misonoo-san is the only
one who hasn't arrived yet.

00:17:27.523 --> 00:17:29.325
Do you know what
happened to her?

00:17:29.792 --> 00:17:31.727
She's... I mean...

00:17:32.528 --> 00:17:37.533
Could... Could I use the
phone? Excuse me...

00:17:37.533 --> 00:17:38.935
I'll be right back!

00:17:43.806 --> 00:17:47.744
I didn't sleep well last night.

00:17:50.012 --> 00:17:56.352
I was just getting sleepy when the sky
got lighter and I heard the delivery boy.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.222
I tried shutting my
eyes even harder...

00:17:59.489 --> 00:18:03.693
But the sky just kept
getting lighter and lighter.

00:18:05.361 --> 00:18:08.431
I got up and took a shower...

00:18:08.898 --> 00:18:14.437
Then I thought I'd use the
time for homework, at least.

00:18:14.771 --> 00:18:18.508
I sat at my desk but
couldn't do anything.

00:18:22.512 --> 00:18:23.913
It's good to talk like this!

00:18:25.582 --> 00:18:27.584
Thank you, Tomoko!

00:18:33.189 --> 00:18:35.392
Hello, this is the
Misonoo residence.

00:18:35.792 --> 00:18:38.728
Nanako has left already.

00:18:39.996 --> 00:18:41.197
She has?

00:18:49.739 --> 00:18:51.741
She did leave already?

00:18:51.741 --> 00:18:54.744
Yes. But something
must have happened.

00:18:54.744 --> 00:18:57.013
She would never be this
late without calling us.

00:19:00.083 --> 00:19:04.688
So now, everyone...
Now we will start the interviews.

00:19:05.622 --> 00:19:08.225
When they hear their name called,

00:19:08.225 --> 00:19:11.561
each candidate should come
into the interview room.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.700
Interviewers, please
come with me.

00:19:26.643 --> 00:19:27.778
Thank you!

00:19:27.978 --> 00:19:29.246
You are welcome.

00:19:29.847 --> 00:19:33.917
It's time! Time to go home
and do my homework.

00:19:33.917 --> 00:19:35.385
Tomoko...

00:19:35.986 --> 00:19:39.523
Thank you. I finally
feel a little relaxed!

00:19:39.923 --> 00:19:43.660
Homework for me, party for
you... What a difference!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.396
This won't happen again.

00:19:45.729 --> 00:19:46.864
I wonder about that...

00:19:46.864 --> 00:19:48.265
But why would it?

00:19:48.265 --> 00:19:50.200
If you are selected...

00:19:52.403 --> 00:19:53.604
Sorry!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.608
Bye!

00:19:58.542 --> 00:19:59.877
Good luck!

00:20:03.881 --> 00:20:06.016
Next, Shinobu Mariko..
<b> </b>

00:20:06.016 --> 00:20:06.684
Next, Shinobu Mariko..
Coming!

00:20:10.821 --> 00:20:13.691
When did you start ballet?

00:20:13.691 --> 00:20:16.427
When I was six, my mom
took me to lessons...

00:20:17.027 --> 00:20:21.031
You had a part in a play
in English in Junior High.

00:20:21.499 --> 00:20:26.170
Yes, I've had a tutor for English and
French since elementary school.

00:20:28.372 --> 00:20:30.441
Well, you may go back now.

00:20:31.976 --> 00:20:33.511
Thank you very much.

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:38.649
That finishes the last
of the candidates.

00:20:38.849 --> 00:20:40.918
Misonoo hasn't arrived yet...

00:20:40.918 --> 00:20:43.521
Misonoo-san? A very
unfortunate case.

00:20:43.521 --> 00:20:46.123
The first rule for the
Sorority is being on time.

00:20:46.257 --> 00:20:48.593
Yet she is late by
more than two hours.

00:20:49.193 --> 00:20:51.596
Is that how she feels
about being a member?

00:20:52.396 --> 00:20:56.601
The party is over.
So, let's wrap it up.

00:20:56.934 --> 00:20:58.202
I beg you!

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:03.274
Please, Miya-sama!
Please give her a little more time!

00:21:06.678 --> 00:21:08.814
[Seiran School, Seiran School.]

00:21:12.684 --> 00:21:14.819
I wonder if Shinobu-san
is already here.

00:21:18.489 --> 00:21:21.292
I wonder if this dress
makes me look too girlish...

00:21:24.295 --> 00:21:27.565
Well, too late to worry about that!

00:21:50.589 --> 00:21:52.057
Kaoru-no-kimi...

00:21:53.325 --> 00:22:01.666
Udaishou Kaoru-no-Kimi in The Tale of Genji
was born with a beautiful aura, like hers...

00:22:21.153 --> 00:22:22.354
Her chest...

00:22:30.629 --> 00:22:34.166
Oh! I'm sorry! I didn't mean to stare.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:37.169
That's ok, no problem.

00:22:37.636 --> 00:22:39.972
Did you just arrive?

00:22:41.173 --> 00:22:42.107
What?

00:22:42.374 --> 00:22:45.310
Aren't you going to
attend the Sorority party?

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:47.246
Yes! That's right...

00:22:47.246 --> 00:22:48.647
You're late.

00:22:49.114 --> 00:22:51.116
Everybody left a few minutes ago.

00:22:51.116 --> 00:22:52.251
What!

00:22:54.319 --> 00:22:56.789
The party was finished
a long time ago.

00:22:57.656 --> 00:23:01.393
No way! The party starts at three!

00:23:02.861 --> 00:23:05.464
So calm you are. Amazing.

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:10.736
There you are, Misonoo-san!

00:23:12.004 --> 00:23:14.340
Why on earth are you HERE?

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:17.209
All the freshmen have left already.

00:23:17.209 --> 00:23:19.678
The Big Sisters are so angry!

00:23:19.678 --> 00:23:21.614
But... the phone call...

00:23:22.148 --> 00:23:24.150
Anyway, hurry up! Hurry up!

00:23:25.017 --> 00:23:25.084
Why?

00:23:25.217 --> 00:23:26.085
Why?

00:23:27.353 --> 00:23:28.888
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:23:28.888 --> 00:23:31.157
What... what happened?

00:24:09.862 --> 00:24:14.067
I dreamed I was
chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.067 --> 00:24:19.539
Then the rainbow I
was chasing was you.

00:24:21.007 --> 00:24:25.144
Before, I had no
strength, no will.

00:24:25.144 --> 00:24:30.617
But now because
of you, I do.

00:24:31.284 --> 00:24:36.956
Feelings of love
like raindrops

00:24:36.956 --> 00:24:42.362
Come pouring
from the sky.

00:24:42.362 --> 00:24:45.098
This is surely a game

00:24:45.165 --> 00:24:47.901
Of some
mischievous fairy...

00:24:47.968 --> 00:24:50.303
Always dancing,

00:24:50.303 --> 00:24:55.508
Always capricious...

00:25:03.583 --> 00:25:06.987
Despite being terribly late for
the selection party,

00:25:06.987 --> 00:25:10.123
Nanako is nevertheless
selected for membership.

00:25:10.123 --> 00:25:14.928
Misaki Aya, rejected by the Sorority, starts
a campaign of slander against Nanako.

00:25:14.928 --> 00:25:20.867
...revealing the affair between her father,
Professor Misonoo, and Nanako's mother...

00:25:21.334 --> 00:25:23.270
Next episode:
The Music Box

00:25:23.270 --> 00:25:24.871
Brother, Dear Brother...
<b> </b>

00:25:24.871 --> 00:25:28.008
Brother, Dear Brother...
There is no end to my tears...
